text = "Varcola U. Kane is a reporter with the rapid response team at Channel 29 News. Kane graduated magna cum laude with a degree in journalism from Tri-Fang University in 2011. She worked at the student paper there and held an internship with the Tri-Fang City Herald before joining Channel 29 in 2016. She primarily covers public safety and topics of local concern for the Tri-City area. She won the Selden Ring Award in 2023 for her work exposing several member's of the mayor's office as vampires."
fit_content = true
scroll_active = false

